<title>SPAIN: Spain's November jobless fell to 14.04 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's November jobless fell to 14.04 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Labour Ministry supplied the following figures:</p>
<p>  UNEMPLOYMENT	     NOV 96    OCT 96	NOV 95</p>
<p> Total (million)		  2.25	 2.23	 2.42</p>
<p> Change on month	  +16,344    +40,099    +20,171</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	  14.04	14.08	15.40</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are based on registered unemployed.</p>
</text>
